    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d607">

                <pb facs="0598" n="1332" xml:id="pg1332"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October 30,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Kurds and Armenians arrested for murder of Lenz. Trial at Erzerum. United States
                    represented at trial by British consul. I have made identical statement with
                    British chargé that failure to protect missionaries in Sassoun in distributing
                    charity would excite prejudice. Protection promised as soon as troops can
                    arrive.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
